tick=1 note the Instance is parked at Failed with its pod still present
tick=1 hold cleared
tick=1 pass result=after:5s
tick=2 note the owner was deleted and its teardown deadline has elapsed before this pass observes either, so the deadline check releases the owner ahead of any teardown wave and the Failed row goes with it
tick=2 apply spec.teardown[deleted] teardown=true now=t+0s
tick=2 apply timer.teardownDeadline to=t+10m1s now=t+10m1s
tick=2 event Warning TeardownDeadlineExceeded teardown deadline 10m exceeded (1 owned pod(s) observed; selector: parent="svc-a", component="engine"); releasing the teardown finalizer to background GC
tick=2 owner deleted rows=1
tick=2 pass result=none
tick=3 note a late pass finds no owner left to act on
tick=3 owner gone; nothing reconciles
tick=3 pass result=none
